('u5_21_coral_production','vocab_coral','u5_21_coral','coral_1','production_context','Boat anchors can break the colourful material that forms reefs, so visitors must use the mooring buoys.','colourful material that forms reefs','["coral"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
